  <title translate="true">ATES Activating GWE Model and Other Packages</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1"><text styleclass="Heading1" translate="true">ATES Activating GWE Model and Other Packages</text></para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Activate the following packages in the &quot;Model|MODFLOW Packages and Programs&quot; dialog box.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">STO, WEL, OBS, GWE, ADV, CND, EST, and SSM.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><image src="ATES_Packages.png" imagestyleclass="Default" scale="-60.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"><title translate="true">Screen capture of the MODFLOW Packages and Programs dialog box showing the selected packages</title><caption translate="true"><![CDATA[Screen capture of the MODFLOW Packages and Programs dialog box showing the selected packages]]></caption></image></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">To better match the example model that comes with MODFLOW 6, make the following changes.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">In the ADV package, select TVD.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">In the CND package, uncheck the &quot;Use XT3D&quot; checkbox.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">In the EST package, set the Heat capacity of water to 4180 and the Latent heat of vaporization to 2500.</text></para>
